{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23550","headline":"秋寄微之十二韵 · 白居易","name":"秋寄微之十二韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"娃馆松江北，稽城浙水东。\n屈君爲长吏，伴我作衰翁。\n旌斾知非远，烟云望不通。\n忙多对酒榼，兴少阅诗筒。\n淡白秋来日，疎凉雨後风。\n余霞数片绮，新月一张弓。\n影满衰桐树，香凋晚蕙丛。\n饥啼春谷鸟，寒怨络丝虫。\n览镜头虽白，听歌耳未聋。\n老愁从此遣，醉笑与谁同。\n清旦方堆案，黄昏始退公。\n可怜朝暮景，销在两衙中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23550.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23550","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}